{"v":1,"seq":21,"id":"01M7TKGR1RKK5GXY29E7P9236V","at":"2026-11-19T19:11:15Z","leg":"L1","type":"message","role":"assistant","text":"It is in. The trip page has a \"Save for offline\" button: it lists the tiles around the itinerary for zoom 10 to 15, drops the deepest zoom levels until the estimate fits in 40 MB, and downloads four at a time with a progress bar and a cancel button. The service worker answers `/tiles/` from the cache first. \"Remove offline map\" deletes the trip's cache.\n\nOne thing to check on your side: the app points at `tiles.example.com`. Make sure that provider allows saving tiles."}
